simulator | residual_variance | S3 | value | dispersion (0.2 + 1 / sqrt(expected count))^2 x 40 / chi-square(40) | sim/s3_trx.R header
simulator | residual_variance | S4 | value | 0.25 x scaled inverse chi-square with 10 degrees of freedom (median residual standard deviation 0.5 log2); 25% of it technical | sim/s4_lipid_metab.R header
